# English translation table for Fetchora.
#
# One entry per line:   <Simplified Chinese source> => <English>
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
# Apply with:  powershell -File tools\make-translations.ps1
#
# Chinese is the *source* language of the project, so anything missing here
# simply stays Chinese in the English UI instead of breaking the build.

